# Input

```scss
:heading(1)/**/.foo { color:red; }
:heading(1)/* first *//* second */.foo { color:red; }
:heading(1)/* line
break */.foo { color:red; }
.foo/**/:heading(1) { color:red; }
:heading(1)/**/#target { color:red; }
:heading(1)/**/[hidden] { color:red; }
:heading(1)/**/:hover { color:red; }
:heading(1)/**/::before { color:red; }
:heading(1)/**/ .foo { color:red; }
:heading(1) /**/.foo { color:red; }
:heading(1)/**/>.foo { color:red; }
:HEADING( 1 )/* biome-ignore format: x */:HEADING(2,3) { color:red; }
.foo/* biome-ignore format: x */:HEADING( 1,2 ) { color:red; }

/* biome-ignore format: preserve the rule */
:heading( 1 )/**/.foo { color:red; }

:/**/heading(1) { color:red; }
:/* first *//* second */heading(1,2) { color:red; }
:/* line
break */heading(1) { color:red; }
:/**/h\65 ading(1) { color:red; }
:/**/heading(1)/**/.foo { color:red; }
:/* biome-ignore format: keep function */HEADING( 1,2 ) { color:red; }
:/**/ heading(1) { color:red; }

```


